Nalin Suksawat — chakhe, Fret Slip phrasing, modal cells, plectrum articulation.
Ellis Ward — jungle drums, break editing, Break Vacancy design, Dry Return structure.
Ploy Kittisak — prepared Rhodes, harmonic handoffs, register continuation.
Arun Meechai — klong thap, woodblock, acoustic transient substitution.
